sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant GPT as ChatGPT
    participant Claude as Claude
    participant Gemini as Gemini

    User->>Orch: Submit query

    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
        note over Orch,Gemini: Parallel fan-out
        par Send to ChatGPT
            Orch->>GPT: Forward prompt
        and Send to Claude
            Orch->>Claude: Forward prompt
        and Send to Gemini
            Orch->>Gemini: Forward prompt
        end
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 230)
        note over GPT,Gemini: Independent inference
        GPT-->>Orch: Response A
        Claude-->>Orch: Response B
        Gemini-->>Orch: Response C
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        note over Orch: Synthesis
        Orch->>Orch: Merge & reconcile responses
        Orch->>Orch: Resolve conflicts / rank answers
    end

    Orch->>User: Final synthesized answer
